5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about the physical space. Can we check the structural survey of the suspended bay?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’d like to see the weekend head counts across ten seasons. The numbers should tell us what actually draws people back.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check the conservation lab staffing and backlog. We need to know who is actually doing the work!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs. I keep hearing about delays, and I want to see exactly where things went wrong before we promise anything.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll look into loan transport costs over three seasons and mount-making charges. I want to see where the money actually goes before we commit.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Benjamin: I’ll look into loan transport costs over three seasons and mount-making charges. I want to see where the money actually goes before we commit.""}]}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’m also looking into the maintenance log for powered displays. I need to know if the room can handle the strain.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I’ll also review the five years of visitor comment slips. The numbers show volume, but the slips show why they return.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’m also checking the composition of the volunteer roster. We need to know who is actually standing in the room!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I’m also checking the maintenance log for powered displays. If things break during opening hours, I don’t want to be the one apologising at the door.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll also check the evening hire bookings. I need to know if the gallery is even available when we need it, or if it’s just a storage unit for caterers.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I think we’ve covered the main risks. I’m a bit quiet, but I hope my concerns about the floor and the machinery are clear.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,The data will speak for itself. I’ll wait for the findings before forming a final opinion.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m ready to hear what we found! I just hope the staff list isn’t as scary as I think.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I’m glad we’re all looking at the same broken bits. I just want to know if we can actually deliver the goods on time, without the whole thing falling apart at the door.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll wait for the invoices to land. Then we’ll see if the budget survives the paperwork.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit nervous about the next steps. I hope the structural survey is clear.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I’ll review the structural survey of the suspended bay. The floor’s limits are a hard constraint, not a suggestion.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I’m picking the structural survey too! If the floor can’t hold the weight, the whole plan is just a fancy daydream.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I’m checking the weekend head counts too. I want to see if people actually show up, or if we’re just guessing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll review the weekend head counts as well. If the room is empty, the budget is just a fancy way to lose money.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
