35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The bay is capped at four hundred kilos per square metre. Last season, stonework needed shoring. I’m worried about the weight.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The data is clear. Head counts rise where mechanisms run, and visitors return because someone is present. We need living exhibits, not static cases.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,One person for two hundred pieces? And the volunteers are already busy with walks! Who is actually left to do the work?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Daisuke, seventeen call-outs? Four with the bay roped off? That’s exactly the kind of mess I was worried about.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A third of the installation budget vanished into couriers. And the joiner’s rate doubled. We are paying for air, not art.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Kenji, yes, the bay was closed. I’m worried the floor can’t handle heavy or moving pieces.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the comment slips confirm your fear. People return for presence, not objects. If the lab is empty, the room is empty.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, exactly! If the lab is empty, the room is empty. We can’t just guess who’s working!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that courier cost is brutal. But those two slipped openings? That’s the real danger. We can’t promise dates if the paperwork is late.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the paperwork is a headache, but the courier bill is a hemorrhage. We are bleeding money before the first visitor even arrives.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I hear you about the presence. But if the bay is roped off for repairs, no one can be present. The floor limits are a hard stop.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the floor is a hard limit, but the data shows presence drives return visits. We need a candidate that fits the weight cap yet offers live interaction.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I agree! But with one lab person and busy volunteers, who actually runs the live sessions? We need a plan for the people, not just the objects!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that’s the scary part. If the paperwork slips, we’re stuck apologising. But if the bay breaks, we’re stuck explaining why the floor is gone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the people are the problem, but the courier bill is the wound. We are bleeding capital before the doors even open.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. We need presence, but the floor is the limit. If the weight is too high, the bay closes, and the presence vanishes.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, Agreed. The floor is the cage. We must find a candidate that fits the weight limit while still offering the live presence the data demands.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I agree! But with one lab person and busy volunteers, who actually runs the live sessions? We need a plan for the people, not just the objects!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, exactly. The floor is the cage, but the paperwork is the key. If the key is late, the cage stays shut.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, The floor is the cage, the courier bill is the tax. We need a show that doesn’t require a freight train to arrive.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
